xxhash.txt
    Outputs of the reference xxHash implementation, xxhash.h of https://github.com/Cyan4973/xxHash at the
    release tag v0.8.3 (BSD 2-Clause License, Copyright (c) 2012-2021 Yann Collet), downloaded from
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Cyan4973/xxHash/v0.8.3/xxhash.h on 2026-10-24 and compiled with
    clang by tools/xxhash_vectors.py. The header itself is not stored here; the file holds only its
    outputs for inputs and secrets generated by the script. The test files of that repository are
    under GPL-2.0 and were not used.
    Used: XXH32 and XXH64 with two seeds, XXH3_64 and XXH3_128 with two seeds and four secrets
    (137, 200, the minimum 136 and 300 bytes), for inputs of 0 to 100003 bytes.
